	<key>readme</key>
	<string># Open URL in Browser

Use Alfred keyword `ou` or press Hyper+O (`⌃⌥⇧⌘O`) while text is selected in macOS to open the selected text as a URL in a new normal Google Chrome window.

This workflow has both an Alfred keyword trigger and an Alfred Hotkey trigger that pass selected macOS text into an AppleScript action. If the input text does not include a URL scheme, the workflow prepends `https://`.

Requires Alfred 5 with Powerpack and Google Chrome. macOS may request permission for Alfred to read selected text and control Chrome.

Author: Yuri Parsons • https://www.ninjakitty.net
</string>
